## INTEGRATION WITH WORKFLOW

### For Catalog Specialist

```python
# After preparing data for creation
if len(items) >= 5:
    result = generate_rich_output(
        title="Products to Create",
        data=items,
        context="Preview for HITL approval",
        company_profile=self.company_profile,
        field_hints={...}
    )
    # Include URL in WriteIntent hitl_summary
```

### For PM

```python
# When presenting complex results
if complex_output:
    result = generate_rich_output(
        title="Operation Summary",
        data=results,
        context="Summary of completed operations",
        company_profile=self.base_context.company_profile,
        field_hints={...}
    )
```

